---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import GuideArticle from '../../components/v2/templates/GuideArticle.astro';
import FAQ from '../../components/FAQ.astro';
import { siteImages } from '../../data/images';
import { getPageSEO } from '../../utils/seo';

const faqItems = [
  { question: 'Where has the Worker been seen?', answer: 'Dated gameplay shows a Worker NPC outside the Grocery. The location and appearance schedule have not been confirmed as permanent.' },
  { question: 'Are the contract cost and duration fixed?', answer: 'No permanent terms are confirmed. Read the cost, duration, and countdown shown in the live Hire panel.' },
  { question: 'What does Manual Assign mean?', answer: 'A dated Hire panel warns that Manual Assign may be disabled after hiring. The exact resulting behavior still needs current gameplay confirmation.' },
];
---

<BaseLayout pageId="guides-how-to-hire-workers" breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Guides', href: '/guides/' }, { label: getPageSEO('guides-how-to-hire-workers').h1 }]}>
<GuideArticle
  title={getPageSEO('guides-how-to-hire-workers').h1}
  kicker="Worker management guide"
  intro="Find the Worker offer shown in your server, read the live contract, and review the Manual Assign warning before hiring."
  tableOfContents
  heroImage={siteImages.workersHero}
  previousPage={{ label: 'Cooking and Serving Guide', href: '/guides/cooking-and-serving/' }}
  nextPage={{ label: 'Restaurant Layout Guide', href: '/guides/restaurant-layout/' }}
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Workers Hub', href: '/workers/', description: 'Review the Worker system and its place in restaurant management.' },
    { label: 'Co-op Guide', href: '/guides/co-op-guide/', description: 'Coordinate restaurant tasks with other players.' },
    { label: 'Beginner Guide', href: '/guides/beginner-guide/', description: 'Learn the complete restaurant service workflow.' },
    { label: 'Upgrade Priority Guide', href: '/guides/upgrade-priority/', description: 'Plan improvements around the restaurant area needing attention.' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="direct-answer">Direct Answer</h2>
  <p>Dated gameplay reviewed by community guides shows a Worker NPC outside the Grocery and a Hire panel with a countdown, contract terms, and a Manual Assign warning. These details are version-sensitive: confirm the NPC location and every term in your current server before accepting.</p>

  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/workers/">Workers Hub</a> defines the system. This page covers the hiring task without treating one recorded location, price, duration, or appearance time as a permanent rule.</p>

  <h2 id="how-it-works">How It Works</h2>
  <p>When a Worker offer is available, its live Hire panel is the authority for the current contract. Older footage can help identify the interface, but it cannot guarantee the same terms or availability.</p>

  <h2 id="hiring-process">Hiring Process</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Check the area outside the Grocery for the Worker offer shown in your server.</li>
    <li>Interact with the Worker to open the current Hire panel.</li>
    <li>Read the displayed cost, contract duration, and countdown rather than relying on an older guide.</li>
    <li>Read the Manual Assign warning in full.</li>
    <li>Confirm only if the live terms match your decision.</li>
    <li>After hiring, observe what the Worker actually does in the current version.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="manual-assign">Manual Assign</h2>
  <p>A dated Hire panel warns that Manual Assign may be disabled after hiring. Available evidence does not establish the exact customer-assignment behavior in every current server, so the guide does not infer more than the warning itself.</p>

  <h2 id="gameplay-tips">Gameplay Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Identify a specific management need before reviewing Worker options.</li>
    <li>Read the complete hiring interface instead of choosing by name alone.</li>
    <li>Keep ingredient, kitchen, dining-area, and layout needs in view.</li>
    <li>Use the <a href="/guides/co-op-guide/">Co-op Guide</a> when active players can divide tasks directly.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="common-mistakes">Common Mistakes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Adding Worker support before identifying the restaurant task that needs help.</li>
    <li>Ignoring the Manual Assign prompt.</li>
    <li>Expecting a Worker to solve missing materials or an unclear layout.</li>
    <li>Changing several parts of restaurant management at the same time.</li>
  </ul>

  <FAQ slot="faq" items={faqItems} />
</GuideArticle>
</BaseLayout>
